| Priority | What | Why |
|----------|------|-----|
| **1 — Now** | Add assertions to `Audit_RunsWithoutError` | False confidence — this test cannot catch regressions |
| **2 — Soon** | Replace `Thread.Sleep` in `Replenish_AsyncJob_Completes` | 3s delay + flake risk on every CI run |
| **3 — Soon** | Add a real skip reason to `Restock_FromSupplier_UpdatesQuantities` or re-enable it | Dead test with no tracking will never come back |
| **4 — Monitor** | Periodically check that `#1487` is progressing | Justified skip, but stale skips are a slow leak |
